  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "英文專題討論與寫作",
    "sub_ename": "ENGLISH RESEARCH PROJECT DISCUSSION AND WRITING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在幫助學生培養應用學術寫作技能，教學內容包括編寫個人研究專題的完整過程，學生需確定研究問題、查詢學術文獻、收集與討論研究資料、回答研究問題，以及進行口頭報告。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to help students develop applied academic writing skills. The teaching unit includes a full process of compiling an individual research project in which students need to work on identifying research questions, locating academic sources, collecting data, discussing data to answer their research questions, and making oral presentations.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
