    "tpa_score_new": null,
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "1. Be on time. 請準時上課。\n2. Participate in the class discussion and class activities. 請參與課堂討論及課堂活動。\n3. Students must submit a leave application to the school in advance, stating the reason for the leave and the expected duration.學生必須提前向學校提交請假申請，說明請假的原因和預計時間。",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>1. Students must exhibit honesty and ethical behavior in their academic activities, avoiding plagiarism and falsification of data.</div>\n\n<div>學生在學術活動中必須展現誠實和道德行為，避免抄襲和篡改資料。<br />\n2. Plagiarism: Proper citation of sources is required. Copying or using others&#39; work without appropriate attribution is considered plagiarism.</div>\n\n<div>抄襲：必須適當引用來源。未經適當標示使用他人作品屬於抄襲行為。<br />\n3. Cheating: Following exam rules is mandatory. Unauthorized materials or collusion with others during exams is considered cheating.</div>\n\n<div>考試作弊：必須遵守考試規則，禁止使用未經授權的材料或與他人串通作弊</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
